 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? That's lovely. Small is wonderful. You don't need to be fluent, just helpful. Can you do simple things? Let her. Let her be the one with the flashcards, the one with the stickers, the one with the red pen. Make it her thing. Some kids will. Then do it together, like a game. Write her name in French, and she can write yours next to it. Ask the teacher which exercises she can do at home. A simple picture matching game can be the whole homework.",
